:: Farm Stock
<<effects>>
<<if $phase2>><<wearProp $phase2>><</if>>

농장의 재고를 확인한다. 알렉스는 농장의 계약을 이행하고 일일 비용을 충당하기 위해 농산물을 판매할 것이다. 남은 농산물은 당신이 가져가 시내에서 팔 수 있도록 냉장고에 보관될 것이다.
<br><br>

가져가지 않은 농산물은 서서히 상할 것이다.
<br><br>
송로버섯: $farm.stock.truffles
<br>
<<if $farm.stock.truffles gte 1>>
	<<set _farm_stocked to true>>
	<<foodstufficon "truffle">><<link [[가져가기|Farm Stock]]>><<set $phase2 to "truffle">><<tending_give truffle $farm.stock.truffles>><<set $farm.stock.truffles to 0>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<br>
달걀: $farm.stock.eggs
<br>
<<if $farm.stock.eggs gte 1>>
	<<set _farm_stocked to true>>
	<<foodstufficon "chicken_egg">><<link [[가져가기|Farm Stock]]>><<set $phase2 to "chicken egg">><<tending_give chicken_egg $farm.stock.eggs>><<set $farm.stock.eggs to 0>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<br>
우유병: $farm.stock.milk
<br>
<<if $farm.stock.milk gte 1>>
	<<set _farm_stocked to true>>
	<<foodstufficon "bottle_of_milk">><<link [[가져가기|Farm Stock]]>><<set $phase2 to "bottle of milk">><<tending_give bottle_of_milk $farm.stock.milk>><<set $farm.stock.milk to 0>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<br>
생크림: $farm.stock.cream
<br>
<<if $farm.stock.cream gte 1>>
	<<set _farm_stocked to true>>
	<<foodstufficon "cream">><<link [[가져가기|Farm Stock]]>><<set $phase2 to "cream">><<tending_give cream $farm.stock.cream>><<set $farm.stock.cream to 0>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<br>

<<if _farm_stocked is true>>
	<<icon "tending/basket.png">>
	<<link [[모두 가져가기|Farm Cottage]]>>
		<<if $farm.stock.truffles gte 1>>
			<<tending_give truffle $farm.stock.truffles>><<set $farm.stock.truffles to 0>>
		<</if>>
		<<if $farm.stock.eggs gte 1>>
			<<tending_give chicken_egg $farm.stock.eggs>><<set $farm.stock.eggs to 0>>
		<</if>>
		<<if $farm.stock.milk gte 1>>
			<<tending_give bottle_of_milk $farm.stock.milk>><<set $farm.stock.milk to 0>>
		<</if>>
		<<if $farm.stock.cream gte 1>>
			<<tending_give cream $farm.stock.cream>><<set $farm.stock.cream to 0>>
		<</if>>
		<<set $phase2 to "farm basket">>
	<</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

<<getouticon>><<link [[떠나기|Farm Cottage]]>><</link>>
